7/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"先生も、どうかお祭りを 楽しんでくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"次の仕事は…あ、先生、 何か手伝ってほしいのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"い、いらっしゃいませ！ 何名様……あ、先生だったか。 すまない。反射でつい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"アルバイトはまだ 終わっていない。最後まで、 気を引き締めていこう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"お祭りも終盤だな。 楽しめたか？先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"今回の仕事も、 無事に終わったな。先生のおかげだ。 恩に着る。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventLogin_Season_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"アルバイトで生計を 立てている身だ。  仕事の案件は、しっかり 管理しなければならない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"せ、先生、私に用か？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_Day_End","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"今日はここまでだ。協力に感謝する。先生、一緒に飲み物でも飲まないか？  ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_Day_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_Get_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"おかげで助かった。 先生は敏腕だな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_Get_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_Get_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"もう片付けたのか…？  お礼にこれを… 受け取ってくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_Get_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_Login_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"悪いが先生、 少し力を貸してくれ。  私一人では手が回らなくてな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_Login_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_EventMission_Login_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"今日の業務リストだ。 先生、手伝ってもらえるか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_EventMission_Login_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"私にできること、私がしたいことは……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"何かが、見える……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"胸が、高鳴る……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"これを……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"もう一曲……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"今だ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"将来は不確かだが、一つだけ断言できる。先生からもらったこの信頼の証は…最後まで、大切にする。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_ExWeapon_Get.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"何をすればいい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Formation_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"業務を全うする。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Formation_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"次はどんな業務だ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Formation_Select.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ここが今回のアルバイト先か…海は初めてだが、任せてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"……これで業務が円滑に進む。礼を言おう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"これを……本当に受け取っていいのか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"次の給料が入ったら、この恩は必ず…… ……むっ、い、要らない……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"計り知れないほど、たくさんの恩が先生にあるというのに、 今の私には、感謝の言葉を返すしかできないのが……もどかしいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"アルバイトだからと、 手を抜くなどあっては ならない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"与えられた業務は、 すべて全力で挑んでいる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"次の給料でミサキに 贈り物をしよう…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"この服装は、アルバイトで 必要だから着ているだけだが…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生が気に入ったと いうのなら、これからも 着るとしよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"海、お祭り…  いつか、 アズサとも一緒に 訪れたいものだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"海もアルバイトも、 知らないことだらけだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"しかしいつまでも 「不慣れ」を言い訳には できない。尽力する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、待っていた。 今日の業務はなんだ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_LogIn_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ん～ん～ん～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_LogIn_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_LogIn_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"せ、先生！？い、今の、 聞こえていたか…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_LogIn_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"終演後の 客席というのは、 寂しいものだな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"大勢いた観客がはけ、 照明はすべて消えて…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"華やかなステージは 跡形もなく、静寂に 沈んでいる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"熱気と歓声に 満ちていた空間が 突如静まると…どこか、 切なさを覚えるほどだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…でも、今はもう、 大丈夫だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"変わったことは 何もないが、 穏やかでいられる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…先生が隣にいるから、 かもしれないな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_MemorialLobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生の変わらぬ支援に、感謝を。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"その……もしよければ…… 先生のために演奏を……あ、いや、なんでもない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"私は常に、先生を応援している。 ……それだけ、覚えていてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0266_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0266_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"働いて給料をもらうのは簡単だ。 しかし先生の信頼に応えるのは……とても難しく感じる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E6%B3%B3%E